  "decision_conditions": [
    "By reason of its excessive scale, bulk and massing, particularly the proposed roof alterations and extensive solar panel coverage, the proposal would constitute an incongruous and discordant form of development, that would cause harm to the character and appearance of the host building and the surrounding area. The development would also fail to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the Kingston Hill/Coombe Hill Strategic Area of Special Character, a non-designated heritage asset. The proposal is therefore considered to be contrary to Policies D3 and HC1 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8, DM10 and DM12 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012."
